n\\begin{aligned}X & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under ${R}_{\\pi }$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 4 & -5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(5,-1),(0,4),(-3,-5).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283706 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283707 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283708 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283709 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283710 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1041 "selection" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283710 13194139534335 true] [17592186283705 1110 #uuid "1ac73cb1-c746-5d3e-8391-bd7cf19d37cc" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283706 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283706 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534335 true] [17592186283706 1111 #uuid "42b368bf-cbc2-5654-89bd-11e05a46b10a" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283707 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283707 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534335 true] [17592186283707 1111 #uuid "53c7fe6b-a158-5c40-8e5c-2bdbc439d18e" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283708 1034 "I only" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283708 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534335 true] [17592186283708 1111 #uuid "389951c4-a9ee-5526-adfe-299f9ff4d3c2" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283709 1034 "III only" 13194139534335 true] [17592186283709 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534335 true] [17592186283709 1111 #uuid "7ff0193a-2dfe-5ba7-92c3-db07bf5746c3" 1